1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:03,140
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) He wants to work at a shoe store.

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:06,860
He prints out his job application.

3
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,660
There are three sheets of paper.

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,540
He goes to the shoe store.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,960
He hands the sheets to the manager.

6
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,880
The manager tells him to staple the sheets.

7
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,160
He does not have a stapler.

8
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:27,520
He finds a paperclip on the floor.

9
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,940
He uses it.
